### Kevalon ERP Module 4: Bank & Cash Accounts Endpoints HTTP Requests Collection
# This file is compatible with the VS Code REST Client extension.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/bank-account
@accessToken = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
@companyId = YOUR_COMPANY_ID
@bankAccountId = YOUR_BANK_ACCOUNT_ID

### 1. Create a New Bank Account (Savings/Current)
# Creates a Savings account. Enforces validation of bankName, accountNumber, and ifscCode.
# Automatically creates a linked COA account under "Bank Accounts" (code 1220).
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "accountType": "Savings",
  "accountName": "HDFC Savings Account",
  "bankName": "HDFC Bank",
  "accountNumber": "501002938192",
  "ifscCode": "HDFC0000123",
  "branchName": "Kothrud Branch",
  "openingBalance": 10000.00,
  "openingBalanceDate": "2026-08-05T00:00:00.000Z"
}


### 2. Create a New Cash Account (Cash/Wallet)
# Creates a Cash account. Does NOT require bankName, accountNumber, or ifscCode.
# Automatically creates a linked COA account under "Current Assets" (code 1200).
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "accountType": "Cash",
  "accountName": "Office Cash Drawer Box",
  "openingBalance": 5000.00
}


### 3. List All Bank & Cash Accounts
# Returns active accounts for the company.
# accountNumber is returned in masked format (e.g., "••••8192").
GET {{baseUrl}}?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 4. List All Accounts (Including Inactive)
# Returns all accounts for the company including disabled ones.
GET {{baseUrl}}?companyId={{companyId}}&includeInactive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 5. Get Single Bank Account Detail
# Returns the detailed view of a bank account, including the UNMASKED accountNumber and the computed currentBalance.
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{bankAccountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 6. Update Bank Account Details
# Updates allow modifying accountName, bankName, ifscCode, branchName, and isActive.
# Reject changes to accountType, accountNumber, and coaAccountId.
# Updates to accountName and isActive automatically sync to the linked COA account document.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{bankAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "accountName": "Updated HDFC Savings Account",
  "branchName": "Kothrud Main Office",
  "isActive": true
}


### 7. Get Account Ledger/Transaction History
# Returns transaction ledger entries for the linked COA account (delegates to placeholder logic for now).
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{bankAccountId}}/ledger?from=2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z&to=2026-08-31T23:59:59.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 8. Reconcile Bank Account
# Submits statement lines, persists them in a reconciliation document, and performs automated ledger matching.
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{bankAccountId}}/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "statementDate": "2026-08-05T00:00:00.000Z",
  "statementLines": [
    {
      "date": "2026-08-04T12:00:00.000Z",
      "description": "UPI Pay to Grocer",
      "amount": 1500.00,
      "type": "debit",
      "referenceNo": "REF100293"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-08-05T09:30:00.000Z",
      "description": "Interest Credited",
      "amount": 350.00,
      "type": "credit",
      "referenceNo": "REF100294"
    }
  ]
}
